The extension_isolated_deps.py module row states that every Ouroboros-owned importer-cache
sweep runs under the module RLock (CPython's PathFinder sweep deletes snapshotted None
entries by key, so overlapping sweeps raised KeyError), that the helper holds it for the
sweep alone while inject/release hold it across their wider dependency bookkeeping, and that
neither span covers plugin import, register or handlers; the chapter had no text for it.
